This is a modified version. Changes made by the EVO Player contributors
include: 7.1 surround audio output (upstream downmixed everything to
stereo), flip-completion synchronisation and triple buffering (fixes
tearing), a rewritten CPU tile swizzle, antialiased rounded-rect UI
primitives, SDF-generated icons, folder-first browser sorting, UI
navigation sounds, and framebuffer screenshots. See the git history for
the full record.

2026-10-12: forked into ps5-twitch as a Twitch client (title PPSA99474);
Twitch code in projects/evoplayer/twitch and ../core. Stage 6 (2026-10-13)
removed the EVO features a Twitch app does not use: the file browser, FTP and
network shares, the media providers and the web UI, subtitles, Surround
Studio, Media Info, the upscaler, motion smoothing, Deep Blacks, the HDR,
120 Hz and frame-rate settings, and audio passthrough.

